<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 23.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 23.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, May 23:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,566.80 (1,582.50)	CHF  1,111.40 (1,125.70)</p>
<p>    DEM    925.73 (937.89)	  GBP  2,568.10 (2,612.70)</p>
<p>    ATS    131.58 (133.25)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $18.83 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$16.85 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $35.68 million ($41.11 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
